Package: com.ratush.isdig
Name: isdig (dig for iOS)
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: DNS diagnostics for Dopamine rootless iOS.
 Pure Python UDP, TCP, verified TLS and HTTPS DNS queries. Supports common
 record types, IPv4/IPv6 reverse lookups, +short and +json. Default server
 comes from Procursus resolv.conf, not the iOS scoped resolver. Use @server
 for explicit tests. Iterative +trace is unsupported and returns an error.
Maintainer: ratush
Author: ratush
Section: Network
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), python3, ca-certificates
